---@class gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.CreateProjectsBuildsRequest
---@field logsBucket? string Cloud Storage bucket where logs should be written (see [Bucket Name Requirements](https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/bucket-naming#requirements)). Logs file names will be of the format `${logs_bucket}/log-${build_id}.txt`.
---@field source? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.Source Optional. The location of the source files to build.
---@field sourceProvenance? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.SourceProvenance Output only. A permanent fixed identifier for source.
---@field failureInfo? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.FailureInfo Output only. Contains information about the build when status=FAILURE.
---@field finishTime? string Output only. Time at which execution of the build was finished. The difference between finish_time and start_time is the duration of the build's execution.
---@field availableSecrets? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.Secrets Secrets and secret environment variables.
---@field buildTriggerId? string Output only. The ID of the `BuildTrigger` that triggered this build, if it was triggered automatically.
---@field images? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.StringList A list of images to be pushed upon the successful completion of all build steps. The images are pushed using the builder service account's credentials. The digests of the pushed images will be stored in the `Build` resource's results field. If any of the images fail to be pushed, the build status is marked `FAILURE`.
---@field artifacts? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.Artifacts Artifacts produced by the build that should be uploaded upon successful completion of all build steps.
---@field timeout? string Amount of time that this build should be allowed to run, to second granularity. If this amount of time elapses, work on the build will cease and the build status will be `TIMEOUT`. `timeout` starts ticking from `startTime`. Default time is 60 minutes.
---@field warnings? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.WarningList Output only. Non-fatal problems encountered during the execution of the build.
---@field steps? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.BuildStepList Required. The operations to be performed on the workspace.
---@field id? string Output only. Unique identifier of the build.
---@field substitutions? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.StringMap Substitutions data for `Build` resource.
---@field queueTtl? string TTL in queue for this build. If provided and the build is enqueued longer than this value, the build will expire and the build status will be `EXPIRED`. The TTL starts ticking from create_time.
---@field approval? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.BuildApproval Output only. Describes this build's approval configuration, status, and result.
---@field dependencies? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.DependencyList Optional. Dependencies that the Cloud Build worker will fetch before executing user steps.
---@field name? string Output only. The 'Build' name with format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/builds/{build}`, where {build} is a unique identifier generated by the service.
---@field secrets? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.SecretList Secrets to decrypt using Cloud Key Management Service. Note: Secret Manager is the recommended technique for managing sensitive data with Cloud Build. Use `available_secrets` to configure builds to access secrets from Secret Manager. For instructions, see: https://cloud.google.com/cloud-build/docs/securing-builds/use-secrets
---@field serviceAccount? string IAM service account whose credentials will be used at build runtime. Must be of the format `projects/{PROJECT_ID}/serviceAccounts/{ACCOUNT}`. ACCOUNT can be email address or uniqueId of the service account.
---@field timing? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.TimeSpanMap Output only. Stores timing information for phases of the build. Valid keys are: * BUILD: time to execute all build steps. * PUSH: time to push all artifacts including docker images and non docker artifacts. * FETCHSOURCE: time to fetch source. * SETUPBUILD: time to set up build. If the build does not specify source or images, these keys will not be included.
---@field results? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.Results Output only. Results of the build.
---@field statusDetail? string Output only. Customer-readable message about the current status.
---@field tags? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.StringList Tags for annotation of a `Build`. These are not docker tags.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.BuildStatusEnum|string Output only. Status of the build.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Time at which the request to create the build was received.
---@field logUrl? string Output only. URL to logs for this build in Google Cloud Console.
---@field startTime? string Output only. Time at which execution of the build was started.
---@field gitConfig? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.GitConfig Optional. Configuration for git operations.
