---@field secrets? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.GitHubEnterpriseSecrets Optional. Names of secrets in Secret Manager.
---@field displayName? string Optional. Name to display for this config.
---@field name string Identifier. The full resource name for the GitHubEnterpriseConfig For example: "projects/{$project_id}/locations/{$location_id}/githubEnterpriseConfigs/{$config_id}"
---@field updateMask? string Update mask for the resource. If this is set, the server will only update the fields specified in the field mask. Otherwise, a full update of the mutable resource fields will be performed.

