---@field repository? string Artifact Registry repository, in the form "https://$REGION-python.pkg.dev/$PROJECT/$REPOSITORY" Files in the workspace matching any path pattern will be uploaded to Artifact Registry with this location as a prefix.

---@alias gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.PythonPackageList gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.PythonPackage[]

---@class gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.ReceiveGithubDotComWebhookRequest
---@field extensions? gcp.unstable.cloudbuild_v1.DocumentMapList Application specific response metadata. Must be set in the first response for streaming APIs.
---@field data? string The HTTP request/response body as raw binary.
---@field contentType? string The HTTP Content-Type header value specifying the content type of the body.
---@field webhookKey? string For GitHub Enterprise webhooks, this key is used to associate the webhook request with the GitHubEnterpriseConfig to use for validation.

